          <div class="lt">The through-line</div>
          <p class="leg-tx" style="line-height:1.65">Nearly every 2025 cluster traced back to the same root: <b>communities where MMR coverage had fallen below the 95% herd-immunity threshold.</b> Where vaccination held, imported cases stopped at one or two.</p>
